                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7d7b4336-375e-3f04-82bf-1c8c11ede3cf",
                        "entry_id": "f0fe250a-f7e1-3fac-98da-5de3891940d9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A small and simple game, especially an incidental game within a larger video game."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "45a1c607-7f0d-457e-b0cd-dff255440986",
                                "sense_id": "7d7b4336-375e-3f04-82bf-1c8c11ede3cf",
                                "text": "If you collect 100 coins, you get to play a balloon-popping minigame."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "70b189b4-bf9f-4da2-9bbc-deaa710d0925",
                                "sense_id": "7d7b4336-375e-3f04-82bf-1c8c11ede3cf",
                                "text": "I promise to enter next time, if you keep the compo like it is now ;-) Or... why not alternating between a minigame compo and a minidemo comp ?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7b3e6016-dbc5-49e3-9d16-9d4324a8a856",
                                "sense_id": "7d7b4336-375e-3f04-82bf-1c8c11ede3cf",
                                "text": "... servers exist online where hundreds or even thousands of users play the game , all sharing space and resources along with other creatures in Minecraft. These servers host many types of gameplay, from minigames, to spleefing (my favorite), ..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d96540c-c794-4d59-b278-42a9622dd3c4",
                                "sense_id": "7d7b4336-375e-3f04-82bf-1c8c11ede3cf",
                                "text": "Dreams’ creative range is astonishing, and it’s possible to make any style of game in minutes, whether it’s a marble run, a city sim, or a rhythm-action minigame within another game. Ettouney hopes this may encourage jaded gamedevs to experiment more: […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6ecf76ea-e196-4321-bf26-667a0c29be56",
                                "sense_id": "7d7b4336-375e-3f04-82bf-1c8c11ede3cf",
                                "text": "Through many of the most iconic RPGs of our time, we’ve seen a range of popular minigames come into focus. […] As you may have figured out by now, Wheels is the unique minigame found throughout Sea of Stars."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
